<title>USA: EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 21-MAY.</title>
<headline>EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 21-MAY.</headline>
<text>
<p>Cleanup continues along the Red River in the upper Plains of the USA and in southern Manitoba, Canada, near Winnepeg.  </p>
<p>Cleanup begins in Bangladesh in the wake of Tropical Cyclone 01B. Severe flooding and wind damage occured with several hundred people dead or missing. Tropical Cyclone 01B has dissipated over southwestern China and is no longer a threat to life and property.  </p>
<p>No additional emergency weather statements.</p>
</text>
